    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Daniel,\n\nGiven your role as founder and lead trial attorney, I thought a more specific follow-up to the intake example might be useful. Getting information into a system is one thing; making it useful when you review a case is another.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould a concise intake summary or an early checklist of missing evidence be more helpful to you? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at CARTER LAW GROUP",
